WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.620
Recursive queries require extra care A wrong join
condition

00:00:05.646 --> 00:00:11.153
can produce too many rows Cycles in the source
hierarchy can also

00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:18.615
create problematic traversal Test the anchor by
itself Inspect

00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:24.143
the recursive join Use depth or path information
while developing

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:29.882
the query Start with a small dataset so the behavior
is visible
